However,

594
00:29:34,350 --> 00:29:35,620
I never imagined

595
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:38,530
beneath its peaceful surface

596
00:29:39,550 --> 00:29:43,620
lay a hidden, dark side.

597
00:29:44,960 --> 00:29:45,810
I quit.

598
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:47,250
Digging like this every day...

599
00:29:47,270 --> 00:29:48,860
What is it all for?

600
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:52,490
Xiong Datou.

601
00:29:52,510 --> 00:29:53,290
What are you doing?

602
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:53,810
Shh.

603
00:29:53,830 --> 00:29:55,140
All we do is dig.

604
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:56,570
What's it for exactly?

605
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:59,180
For the Deity, of course.

606
00:29:59,310 --> 00:30:00,530
The Deity blesses us

607
00:30:00,550 --> 00:30:01,460
and gives us a home.

608
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:02,860
We must repay him.

609
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:03,810
Nonsense.

610
00:30:04,270 --> 00:30:05,330
- That's not true.
- Watch it.

611
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:05,900
Hold your tongue.

612
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,620
I entered the Forbidden Land.

613
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:07,980
He...

614
00:30:08,270 --> 00:30:09,010
- The Forbidden Land?
- He went there?

615
00:30:09,030 --> 00:30:10,290
That will anger the Deity.

616
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:12,570
You're all fooled.

617
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:15,900
No one is protecting us at all.

618
00:30:15,920 --> 00:30:17,330
In there stands a stone stele,

619
00:30:17,350 --> 00:30:19,980
saying there is no deity in this world.

620
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:21,460
No deity.

621
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:23,730
Xiong Datou, you're crazy. Stop lying.

622
00:30:23,750 --> 00:30:24,330
Get down.

623
00:30:24,350 --> 00:30:25,490
No deity.

624
00:30:25,830 --> 00:30:26,380
Nonsense.

625
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:27,180
You're all fooled.

626
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:27,900
Stop the nonsense.

627
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:29,250
You're all fooled.

628
00:30:29,270 --> 00:30:30,900
No deity at all.

629
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:31,460
Xiong Datou.

630
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:32,220
No deity.

631
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:44,010
Forgive us.

632
00:30:44,030 --> 00:30:45,620
We beg for your forgiveness.

633
00:30:45,640 --> 00:30:46,620
Show mercy.

634
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:48,250
You're all fooled.

635
00:30:49,480 --> 00:30:50,490
Show mercy.

636
00:30:51,510 --> 00:30:52,420
Please, mercy.

637
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:53,700
It was our fault.

638
00:30:53,720 --> 00:30:54,730
Take pity on us.

639
00:30:54,880 --> 00:30:56,250
Have some mercy.

640
00:31:00,510 --> 00:31:01,330
Spare our lives.

641
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:02,770
Forgive our sins.

642
00:31:08,550 --> 00:31:09,420
He's gone.

643
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:10,700
Let's go.

644
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:12,140
Where is Xiong Datou?

645
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:14,980
Datou is gone.

646
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:15,810
Where's Datou?

647
00:31:21,030 --> 00:31:23,730
We... we love Bear Island.

648
00:31:23,830 --> 00:31:25,860
Bear Island is so great.

649
00:31:25,880 --> 00:31:27,900
Listen to the deity.

650
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:29,940
And we'll live forever.

651
00:31:29,960 --> 00:31:31,860
We love Bear Island.

652
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:33,810
Bear Island is so great.

653
00:31:33,830 --> 00:31:36,040
- Listen to the deity.
- After that,

654
00:31:36,080 --> 00:31:39,380
- the man was never seen again.
- And we'll live forever.

655
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:40,660
However,

656
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:42,090
a few days later,

657
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:44,420
when the tide came in,

658
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,050
it washed up

659
00:31:48,070 --> 00:31:49,460
a severed arm,

660
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:51,570
still wearing

661
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:55,330
his clothes from that day.

662
00:32:02,590 --> 00:32:03,730
Is someone over there?

663
00:32:05,070 --> 00:32:05,730
Where?

664
00:32:06,480 --> 00:32:07,140
Who's there?

665
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:08,330
Didn't you see?

666
00:32:09,070 --> 00:32:09,900
Right there.

667
00:32:13,160 --> 00:32:14,250
I see no one.

668
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:17,250
Scaring yourself
with your made-up story?

669
00:32:17,590 --> 00:32:18,700
Not made-up.

670
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:19,770
It's all true.

671
00:32:20,550 --> 00:32:21,730
Pathetic.

672
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:46,770
There's a bearded man over there.

673
00:33:04,350 --> 00:33:05,140
Yunxiao.

674
00:33:06,070 --> 00:33:07,900
Could you stop wandering off?

675
00:33:07,960 --> 00:33:09,660
Why do you always care where I go?

676
00:33:10,070 --> 00:33:12,330
The atmosphere on this island
is so eerie.

677
00:33:12,350 --> 00:33:13,620
And you have no power.

678
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:15,420
You should be more careful.

679
00:33:15,440 --> 00:33:16,570
Even without power,

680
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,290
I must find the Pregenesis Sword.

681
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:19,490
Yunxiao.

682
00:33:20,310 --> 00:33:21,140
Your stubbornness

683
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,860
makes things tough for me.

684
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:25,050
What's it to you?

685
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:27,570
Why are you so set

686
00:33:27,590 --> 00:33:28,810
on getting the Sea-Calming Pillar?

687
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:30,660
What lies beneath the Eye of the Sea?

688
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:31,530
- You can't just...
- Enough.

689
00:33:31,550 --> 00:33:32,490
Negotiation over.

690
00:33:34,790 --> 00:33:35,570
Yunxiao.

691
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:37,460
If you refuse to listen,

692
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:39,180
I won't be nice anymore.

693
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:42,180
You wouldn't dare.

694
00:33:44,590 --> 00:33:46,140
Neither of us has power anyway.

695
00:33:48,550 --> 00:33:49,620
Bring it on.

696
00:33:51,590 --> 00:33:52,380
Oh yeah?

697
00:33:53,310 --> 00:33:53,940
Fine then.

698
00:33:55,310 --> 00:33:57,220
Ke Le'er.

699
00:33:57,240 --> 00:33:57,980
Hold on.

700
00:33:58,510 --> 00:33:59,290
What's up?

701
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:00,620
Found my savior for me?

702
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:01,810
You bet.

703
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:02,660
Well,

704
00:34:02,680 --> 00:34:03,810
you see him every day.

705
00:34:04,070 --> 00:34:04,980
He is...

706
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:06,700
He is Hua Ritian.

707
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:07,660
Think about it.

708
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:08,740
Just four outsiders.

709
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,740
Qing Luan is a girl.

710
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:10,340
Excluding yourself,

711
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:11,090
and you know my deal.

712
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:11,900
Who else could it be?

713
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,690
Hua Ritian.

714
00:34:12,710 --> 00:34:13,340
Exactly.

715
00:34:14,030 --> 00:34:14,570
Makes sense.

716
00:34:15,150 --> 00:34:16,340
Wait, actually...

717
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:17,900
Actually, he's been hiding his identity.

718
00:34:17,920 --> 00:34:19,090
That must be intentional.

719
00:34:19,110 --> 00:34:19,980
Since he's your savior,

720
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:20,860
he definitely recognizes you.

721
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:22,340
So why pretend not to know you?

722
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:23,610
Means he's protecting you.

723
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:25,340
That makes total sense.

724
00:34:25,510 --> 00:34:26,740
Think further.

725
00:34:27,030 --> 00:34:28,690
If he had a fake beard...

726
00:34:28,710 --> 00:34:30,460
With a beard, wouldn't he look closer?

727
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:36,490
- Seems so.
- Definitely looks closer.

728
00:34:36,510 --> 00:34:37,380
So go find Hua Ritian.

729
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:38,170
Test him right away.

730
00:34:38,190 --> 00:34:38,380
Okay.

731
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:38,940
Go find him.

732
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:39,530
Hurry.

733
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:42,940
Quick tongue, huh?

734
00:34:44,150 --> 00:34:44,980
Fortunately.

735
00:35:00,480 --> 00:35:01,300
Stop sniffing.

736
00:35:01,920 --> 00:35:03,130
I bathe every day.

737
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:04,300
No body odor.

738
00:35:07,360 --> 00:35:09,530
You admire the view here daily.

739
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:10,900
But the view here is

740
00:35:11,670 --> 00:35:12,460
ordinary.

741
00:35:12,550 --> 00:35:13,340
Ordinary?

742
00:35:16,110 --> 00:35:16,940
Ordinary.

743
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:17,900
That's the point.

744
00:35:19,110 --> 00:35:19,900
Ordinary

745
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:22,130
is where its beauty lies.

746
00:35:24,710 --> 00:35:26,740
Every word you say

747
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:29,130
sounds so profound.

748
00:35:33,960 --> 00:35:35,170
Even to the ends of the sea,

749
00:35:36,960 --> 00:35:38,170
a true soulmate is rare to see.

750
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:44,980
If you want to leave someday,

751
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:48,010
I can show you better views.

752
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:50,130
Where to?

753
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:53,820
Hua.

754
00:35:55,150 --> 00:35:56,490
Have you seen the Dragon Palace?

755
00:35:58,630 --> 00:35:59,530
Dragon Palace?

756
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:05,380
Carved pillars, jade tiles,

757
00:36:06,320 --> 00:36:07,610
decked in pearls and jewels.

758
00:36:08,320 --> 00:36:09,530
Utterly lavish,

759
00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:12,420
yet dark and dreary.

760
00:36:14,550 --> 00:36:16,010
Not as open and free as here.

761
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:17,780
You really went there?

762
00:36:18,550 --> 00:36:19,130
I've seen it.

763
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:21,570
Have you seen a dragon?

764
00:36:24,360 --> 00:36:25,610
Summoning clouds and rain,

765
00:36:26,230 --> 00:36:27,380
soaring in the skies,

766
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,050
arrogant and mighty,

767
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:33,380
yet trapped in the sea.

768
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:36,380
So true, Hua.

769
00:36:36,510 --> 00:36:37,420
You really are...

770
00:36:37,440 --> 00:36:38,420
I've seen

771
00:36:40,630 --> 00:36:41,420
too much.

772
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:44,340
Way too much.

773
00:36:46,670 --> 00:36:47,300
So,

774
00:36:48,150 --> 00:36:49,490
you're so amazing.

775
00:36:49,550 --> 00:36:50,820
Why stay on Bear Island?

776
00:36:52,670 --> 00:36:53,460
Bear Island?

777
00:36:54,150 --> 00:36:55,090
What's wrong with it?

778
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:58,170
This peaceful sanctuary

779
00:36:58,960 --> 00:36:59,940
is so quiet and serene.

780
00:37:00,670 --> 00:37:02,260
Doesn't it entrance you?

781
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:05,090
I've been to many scenic places.

782
00:37:05,110 --> 00:37:06,530
Compared to those,

783
00:37:06,760 --> 00:37:07,650
this is nothing.

784
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:09,820
What have you seen?

785
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:10,900
I...

786
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:15,940
Have you seen the world's creation?

787
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:18,740
Heaven and earth blended as one.

788
00:37:19,190 --> 00:37:20,490
Vast without directions.

789
00:37:21,670 --> 00:37:22,690
Have you seen 100,000 stars

790
00:37:22,710 --> 00:37:24,210
destruct all at once?

791
00:37:27,150 --> 00:37:28,650
Light illuminated everything,

792
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:31,130
then destroyed it all.

793
00:37:32,190 --> 00:37:33,940
Have you seen reincarnation?

794
00:37:34,760 --> 00:37:36,780
Seen hellish ghosts wailing?

795
00:37:37,230 --> 00:37:39,780
Seen tragic partings
in the mortal world?

796
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:43,610
I have.

797
00:37:47,360 --> 00:37:48,420
I've seen

798
00:37:50,230 --> 00:37:51,010
too much.

799
00:37:53,630 --> 00:37:54,610
Way too much.

800
00:38:02,440 --> 00:38:03,380
Let me tell you,

801
00:38:06,550 --> 00:38:07,380
in this world,

802
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:11,050
the rarest beauty

803
00:38:12,670 --> 00:38:13,820
is being ordinary.

804
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:15,610
My savior.

805
00:38:16,190 --> 00:38:17,940
You are my lifelong faith.

806
00:38:22,190 --> 00:38:23,340
It is everything

807
00:38:26,070 --> 00:38:27,690
right before your eyes.

808
00:38:56,340 --> 00:38:59,620
[Forbidden Land]

809
00:39:13,900 --> 00:39:22,460
[Forbidden Land]

810
00:39:25,550 --> 00:39:26,530
Yunxiao's footprint.

811
00:39:28,590 --> 00:39:31,210
Hope she never learns
to hide her tracks.

812
00:39:40,320 --> 00:39:41,300
This is...

813
00:39:46,550 --> 00:39:47,530
an Object-Seeking Talisman.

814
00:39:48,150 --> 00:39:50,340
No power works on Bear Island,

815
00:39:50,360 --> 00:39:52,570
why would someone burn a talisman?

816
00:39:53,820 --> 00:39:58,100
[There is no deity in this world]

817
00:40:14,180 --> 00:40:15,740
[Because...]

818
00:40:16,030 --> 00:40:19,130
Today's rocks are hauled up.

819
00:40:19,840 --> 00:40:20,900
Great Deity,

820
00:40:21,230 --> 00:40:24,300
you can inspect anytime.

821
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:25,940
A local?

822
00:40:25,960 --> 00:40:27,460
You've been digging for centuries.

823
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:29,130
When will you find it?

824
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:30,780
Telepathy.

825
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:32,090
We've done all we can.

826
00:40:32,110 --> 00:40:34,050
Isn't power forbidden here?

827
00:40:34,070 --> 00:40:36,420
Great Deity,

828
00:40:36,550 --> 00:40:37,460
we'd never

829
00:40:37,760 --> 00:40:40,940
dare neglect your orders.

830
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:42,420
Then keep digging.

831
00:40:42,440 --> 00:40:43,980
Dig another few centuries.

832
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:46,530
I believe
the Pregenesis Sword will show.

833
00:40:46,590 --> 00:40:48,130
Someone else is hunting the sword?

834
00:41:02,670 --> 00:41:03,170
This is

835
00:41:05,550 --> 00:41:06,420
a formation?

836
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:14,740
Check it for me.

837
00:41:14,760 --> 00:41:16,490
How long until the Great Tribulation?

838
00:41:17,150 --> 00:41:19,860
Thirty years remain.

839
00:41:20,510 --> 00:41:21,380
Thirty years.

840
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:24,090
Sword appears
and opens the Eye of the Sea,

841
00:41:24,110 --> 00:41:25,260
triggering Great Tribulation.

842
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:27,610
Even if Fairy Yunxiao fails,

843
00:41:27,630 --> 00:41:29,300
others will grab the Pregenesis Sword.

844
00:41:33,590 --> 00:41:34,570
In that case,

845
00:41:35,760 --> 00:41:37,300
the only way to break this

846
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:40,780
is to obtain the Pregenesis Sword

847
00:41:43,190 --> 00:41:44,900
before anyone else.

848
00:42:17,590 --> 00:42:23,370
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

849
00:42:24,040 --> 00:42:30,740
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

850
00:42:32,270 --> 00:42:38,320
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

851
00:42:38,950 --> 00:42:45,400
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

852
00:42:46,140 --> 00:42:53,260
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

853
00:42:53,640 --> 00:43:00,540
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

854
00:43:00,920 --> 00:43:08,270
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

855
00:43:08,270 --> 00:43:15,440
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

856
00:43:31,580 --> 00:43:36,750
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

857
00:43:37,840 --> 00:43:44,860
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

858
00:43:46,050 --> 00:43:51,990
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

859
00:43:52,690 --> 00:43:59,770
♪Alas, our story is short♪

860
00:44:00,110 --> 00:44:07,220
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

861
00:44:07,540 --> 00:44:14,020
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

862
00:44:14,800 --> 00:44:22,010
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

863
00:44:22,400 --> 00:44:30,220
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
